+
+## Bare oracle loop
+
+| Preset | Model | Seed | Solved | Recorded reason |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---|
+| easy | GPT-5.6 Terra | 1966918154 | yes | exact witness verified |
+| easy | Grok 4.6 | 2097807930 | yes | exact witness verified |
